		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Frothy scarlet jelly that extends long tendrils to move about. Adaptive, acclimated to dark places.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 36, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tendril (near) +6 (2d6 + acidic grab), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acidic Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or target held and 2d6 damage per round. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Adaptive</strong>. After taking damage from an energy type, becomes immune to that energy type for 10 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ooze Spawn</strong>. Immune to acid.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
